  "stories": [
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Profile",
        "zh": "客观履历",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Croissant, a member of Penguin Logistics, is a proficient defender who is able to hold back several enemies at once. She also possesses monstrous strength, able to send lesser enemies flying with her massive hammer.",
        "zh": "企鹅物流员工，于合约期内任企鹅物流驻罗德岛外派干员。 擅长防守，能同时牵制数个敌人，并拥有怪力，能用巨锤轻松击飞瘦弱的敌人。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "DIRECT"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Clinical Analysis",
        "zh": "临床诊断分析",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Imaging tests reveal clear, normal outlines of internal organs, and no abnormal shadows have been detected. Originium granules have not been detected in the circulatory system and there is no sign of infection. At this time, this Operator is believed to be non-infected. \n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 0% \nOperator Croissant showed no symptoms of Oripathy. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.12u/L \nOperator Croissant sometimes delivers packages or sells goods with Originium content, but it has not caused infection to date.",
        "zh": "造影检测结果显示，该干员体内脏器轮廓清晰，未见异常阴影，循环系统内源石颗粒检测未见异常，无矿石病感染迹象，现阶段可确认为非矿石病感染者。\n\n【体细胞与源石融合率】0%\n干员可颂没有被源石感染的迹象。\n\n【血液源石结晶密度】0.12u/L\n干员可颂有时会递送含源石成分的包裹或售卖源石制品，但至今尚未因此致病。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "25"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 1",
        "zh": "档案资料一",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "An energetic messenger. \nShe believes that the purpose of work is to improve one's quality of life, and that shopping is the best way to improve her life. \nShe isn't hung up on money, but she does enjoy living paycheck-to-paycheck while jumping on opportunities to make a quick profit. She can often be seen hawking goods in various places.",
        "zh": "充满活力的信使少女。\n认为工作的目标就是为了提高生活品质和买买买，全心享受着现代生活。\n对金钱并不执着，但因为总是入不敷出，所以总是在寻找着赚钱的机会，经常能看到她在基地内摆摊的身影。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "50"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 2",
        "zh": "档案资料二",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Messengers usually get two kinds of work: Delivering mail and messages, or transporting cargo. \nThe former requires speed; the latter, strength and endurance. In Penguin Logistics, Croissant was an obvious stand-out in the latter. \nAlso notable, Croissant is extraordinarily strong even for a Forte. Swinging a hefty hammer in one hand while carrying a heavy shield in the other is as simple as breathing to her.",
        "zh": "信使的工作通常分为两种，一种是传递信件或者信息，另一种则是传递货物。\n前者需要速度，而后者，则往往需要力气和耐性。在企鹅物流中，可颂小姐显然主要负责后一种的信使工作。\n而且，需要指出的是，即使作为丰蹄，可颂小姐的怪力也是惊人的。她能够单手挥舞那把几十公斤的磁暴锤，另一只手还能使用重盾，这对她来说是如同呼吸一样简单的事。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "100"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 3",
        "zh": "档案资料三",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "While not a big operation, Penguin Logistics is well-connected at all levels in Lungmen. \nThus, taking advantage of the channels back home, Croissant's irregular hawking ventures could be a treasure trove that just might offer rarities you wouldn't find anywhere else. \nOf course, don't let Croissant know if you did spot a valuable item, or she will wring your wallet.",
        "zh": "企鹅物流虽然规模不大，但在龙门之中拥有相当的灰色地位，和各方都有所接触。\n因此，利用了这些渠道来收集货物的可颂小姐，她不定时开张的店铺事实上是不容小觑的。说不定在其中，就能发现一些不得了的东西。\n——当然，如果真的有的话，最好不要让可颂小姐察觉，不然的话，她可不会在价格上客气。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "150"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 4",
        "zh": "档案资料四",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Even as an Operator, Croissant has no plans to give up her hobbies and interests. \nShe knows an Operator will face unprecedented danger and see many unfortunate events. Nevertheless, she is still a city girl who counts her pennies. \nMaybe Rhodes Island recruits civilian Operators because they're not jaded and thus fearless, but it's definitely not because they should be exposed to the cruelty of the real world. It's more like Rhodes Island have many unfortunate people who needed someone as adorable as Croissant to show them what a normal, blissful life is like. \nOf course, the unfortunate or hateful may begrudge the blessed, but at least it never happens at Rhodes Island.",
        "zh": "即使成为了干员，可颂小姐也完全不打算放弃她在日常生活中的兴趣爱好。\n她知道成为干员后要面临许多前所未有的危险，她也知道成为干员后会遇到很多笑不出来的事，她没有忽视这些，而是在此之上，她依然会是那个精打细算的都市少女。\n这或许只是温室中花朵的初生牛犊不怕虎，但罗德岛吸收民间干员的本意，也绝不是出于想让他们认识到世界的残酷这样愚蠢的理由。倒不如说，罗德岛之中已经有太多不幸的人，需要有可颂小姐这样可爱的人去告诉他们，幸福而正常的生活是什么样的。\n当然，不幸的人或许会去仇恨幸福的人，但这种事，至少绝不会发生在罗德岛之中。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "200"
    }
  ]
}
